Subject: power: sequencing: support the Piano Qualcomm WCN controller

Carry the WCN power sequence required by the PCI WLAN and UART Bluetooth functions.

The port retains changes from these linux-piano commits:
piano: fix PCIe diagnostic addresses and trace PMU GPIO acquisition (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)
BACKPORT-ELDEN: wifi/bt/pwrseq: Peach v2 (WCN7861) support from the Lenovo Y700 Gen4 port (GEEKiDoS <geek_ds@foxmail.com>)

Co-authored-by: bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: GEEKiDoS <geek_ds@foxmail.com>

